# env files with secrets - matches .env and worker.env at any depth.
# The hub schemas are named hub-*/environment.example, which this does not match, so they stay
# tracked. worker.env.example is likewise a different name.
*.env
# direnv's loader, at any depth. It holds the operator's OpenStack application
# credential and the state passphrase. *.env does NOT match it: that pattern is a
# suffix glob and this name ends in "rc". .envrc.example is a different name, so
# the committed schema stays tracked.
.envrc
hub/db_data/
# The dev-box defaults for two of the three per-host paths in hub-database/environment.example. On
# the VM both live outside the repo; here they are working state. Both are also things that must
# never be committed on any host: the cluster itself, and a private key.
hub-database/pgdata/
hub-database/certs/
# NOT a current default: LAMIN_HOME now defaults to ~/.clinicalomxdb/lamin, outside the tree, so the
# API key and the Postgres URI the connect writes never land in the repo at all. KEEP this line
# anyway. It is the only thing stopping those credentials being committed by a developer whose .env
# still names the old in-tree ./lamin, which keeps working. Not dead, so do not delete it.
hub-database/lamin/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info/
.DS_Store
*.sqlite3

# Portal dev loop artefacts: captures and queued edit intents are local working state.
hub-ops/devserver/shots/
hub-ops/devserver/notes.jsonl
# Backup the inspector writes before touching index.html.
*.html.bak

# Lavish review surfaces: a rendering of something already recorded elsewhere, plus a copy
# of the house stylesheet from home-config. Regenerated on demand, so it is working state.
.lavish/

# Prismor state: session state and absolute machine paths, at every depth. Never commit it.
.prismor/

# VM runtime artifacts observed by O-1 (2026-08-28): these appear in the deployed
# checkout's git status and bury real drift. Exactly what was observed, nothing wider.
# *.egg-info/ from that list is already covered above.
hub-pipelines/prefect/worker-home/
hub-pipelines/prefect/prefect-home/
hub-database/sandbox/
hub-database/.lavish/
hub-storage/hpc_scratch/project/
